{"id":"7941b5e851990dd5","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md","title":"Polyhedron","display":"df-polyhedron — Polyhedron","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-polyhedron","aliases":["58-df-polyhedron"],"display":"df-polyhedron — Polyhedron","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-polyhedron"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-polyhedron</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-polyhedron — Polyhedron"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|K|\\in V\">\\(|K|\\in V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3a061d5c71f82e51\" href=\"?note=3a061d5c71f82e51\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md\">../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{|\\sigma|}\\in V\">\\(\\tau_{|\\sigma|}\\in V\\)</span>（有限实现单纯形 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|\">\\(|\\sigma|\\)</span> 的欧氏子空间拓扑）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md\">../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,A)\\land\\tau_K=\\{U\\subseteq|K|:\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;(U\\cap|\\sigma|\\in\\tau_{|\\sigma|})\\}\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,X,\\tau_X,|K|,\\tau_K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,A)\\land\\tau_K=\\{U\\subseteq|K|:\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;(U\\cap|\\sigma|\\in\\tau_{|\\sigma|})\\}\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,X,\\tau_X,|K|,\\tau_K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron} \\vdash \\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,A,\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron} \\vdash \\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,A,\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Polyhedra are spaces homeomorphic to geometric realizations equipped with the weak topology determined simplexwise. This topology is essential for infinite complexes.</li>\n<li>复形、顶点集和弱拓扑先组成显式数据谓词，再由存在量化得到性质谓词；所有同胚参数均落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 中。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md","status":"resolved","id":"3a061d5c71f82e51","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $|K|\\in V$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-simplicial-complex.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-homeomorphism.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"|K|\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{|\\sigma|}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"|\\sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron\\text{-}data}\\vdash\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{SimplicialComplex}_S(K,A)\\land\\tau_K=\\{U\\subseteq|K|:\\forall\\sigma\\in K\\;(U\\cap|\\sigma|\\in\\tau_{|\\sigma|})\\}\\land\\exists h\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,X,\\tau_X,|K|,\\tau_K)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}polyhedron} \\vdash \\mathrm{Polyhedron}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\leftrightarrow\\exists K,A,\\tau_K\\in V\\;\\mathrm{PolyhedronData}_S(X,\\tau_X,K,A,\\tau_K)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1735,"backlinks":[{"id":"b80ea50ccf56b0ca","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-963","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-polyhedron.md|58-df-polyhedron]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["3a061d5c71f82e51","815e63e5071e7b58","c4b4a825f2ea608d"]}